    <description>DIR-869: Releases the per-Quote submission mutex acquired by RES_Autolaunched_Try_Acquire_Submission_Mutex, so future discount submissions on this Quote can acquire it again. Called from RES_Autolaunched_Update_Quote_Status whenever the discount submission lock is reset (Approved/Rejected/Recalled).</description>
